[00:00.000] 作词 : 艾迪娜
[00:01.000] 作曲 : 艾迪娜
[00:08.503]You don’t need to do that much
[00:14.256]Or else you’ll feel unbalanced
[00:19.513]Struggler  struggling
[00:30.009]
[00:30.502]There’s so much need to be unlearned
[00:36.006]Useless information
[00:41.753]Poisoners poisoning
[00:50.752]
[00:52.257]The streets had seen you cry, too many times
[01:03.180]Let it go
[01:06.437]
[01:08.684]Cause the sun will follow wherever you go
[01:15.681]（the dog days are temporary they will be over)
[01:20.441]（when they come again it’s nothing you never know）
[01:29.767]
[01:50.779]I guess we’re made to overthink
[01:56.029]But the feeling of living
[02:01.267]Is when your heart skips a beat
[02:12.779]They say it’s all but just a game
[02:17.772]Maybe it’s true
[02:20.516]We’re all the same
[02:23.517]Strugglers struggling
